{
  "$id": "https://ling.local/contracts/v1/ImageNewerRelease.schema.json",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "description": "本次检查发现的更高版本（``compatible=false`` 的也保留）。\n\n事实源是更新器的 ``release_check.latest``（查 GHCR tags/manifest 得出），\n所以列表通常只有一条。与\"可提交目标\"的**关键差别**：``digest`` 允许为 null。\n「有新版但拿不到安装包」是必须能显示给用户的事实（否则页面只剩一句\n\"暂无可更新的版本\"，用户分不清是没发版还是没构建产物）；摘要为空的条目\n永远进不了 ``target``，不能用它构造安装请求。",
  "properties": {
    "commit": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Commit"
    },
    "compatible": {
      "title": "Compatible",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "digest": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Digest"
    },
    "has_migration": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "deprecated": true,
      "title": "Has Migration"
    },
    "incompatible_reason": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Incompatible Reason"
    },
    "incompatible_reason_message": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Incompatible Reason Message"
    },
    "notes": {
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Notes",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "notes_url": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Notes Url"
    },
    "summary": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Summary"
    },
    "version": {
      "title": "Version",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "version",
    "compatible"
  ],
  "title": "ImageNewerRelease",
  "type": "object",
  "x-ling-schema-version": "v1"
}
